    "Batch intake: boxes × units per box and total invoice cost; the server derives unit cost.",
    "Return to the supplier (expired, near expiry, recalled, damaged, excess, wrongly supplied): from a batch, the quantity, the reason and a note (POST /pharmacy-admin/batches/{batch_id}/supplier-returns; a recalled batch with reason Recall and its recall_id), then print the return note for the goods. Show each return's status: Returned until the accountant confirms the credit note, then Credited or Refused (decisions 47).",
